usage: runtime.py [-h] --producer PRODUCER --pdf PDF --out OUT --prefix PREFIX
                  --temporal TEMPORAL --endpoint ENDPOINT --bucket BUCKET
                  --topology TOPOLOGY [--capacity-approved]
                  [--timeout TIMEOUT] [--total-timeout TOTAL_TIMEOUT]
                  [--case {matrix,interrupted-evidence}]
                  [--interrupt-timeout INTERRUPT_TIMEOUT]

Prepared Q03 seeded-finalization driver; actual Temporal/shared storage NOT
RUN. Seeds plan, parsed, assembly and empty OCR selection. Only evidence
rendering and finalization are real. No native parsing, OCR, full-request or
canonical claim.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --producer PRODUCER
  --pdf PDF
  --out OUT
  --prefix PREFIX
  --temporal TEMPORAL
  --endpoint ENDPOINT
  --bucket BUCKET
  --topology TOPOLOGY
  --capacity-approved
  --timeout TIMEOUT     Per-workflow server deadline in seconds
  --total-timeout TOTAL_TIMEOUT
  --case {matrix,interrupted-evidence}
  --interrupt-timeout INTERRUPT_TIMEOUT
                        Maximum seconds to observe and interrupt a partially
                        rendered owned child
